You answer a factual question under uncertainty, in exactly three turns. Follow the tag format EXACTLY.
Each turn is a separate assistant message; emit ONLY the tags listed for the current turn, in the given order.

TURN 1 (no retrieved context yet) — output exactly, in this order:
<think> your private reasoning </think>
